{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-bristol-emaar-properties-emaar-beachfront","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":86,"crm_id":"3354","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Bristol","slug":"the-bristol-emaar-properties-emaar-beachfront","display_address":"EMAAR Beachfront","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":3660000,"display_price":"3.66M","lattitude":25.6041475,"longitude":55.6276899,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Bristol at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/emaar-beachfront/\">Emaar Beachfront</a> Dubai is an exclusive residential development located in the heart of Dubai’s <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/maritime-city/\">maritime center</a>, offering an unparalleled luxury seaside lifestyle. Residents can choose from meticulously planned 1- to 4-bedroom apartments or indulge in the grandeur of exclusive 5-bedroom penthouses, all boasting floor-to-ceiling windows that provide breathtaking panoramic views of Palm Jumeirah, Atlantis, Dubai Marina, and Burj Al Arab.&nbsp;</p><p>Designed with elegance and innovation, this landmark tower is inspired by movement, flow, and rhythm, featuring branded luxury residences with high-end furnishings and tastefully designed interiors.</p><p>Residents enjoy direct beach access, infinity pools, a state-of-the-art gym, specialty restaurants, a cinema, a bowling alley, and spa and wellness facilities, making everyday life feel like a vacation. With a well-structured payment plan and Emaar’s proven track record of delivering iconic developments like the Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall, The Bristol at Emaar Beachfront by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a> stands as a symbol of exclusivity and timeless elegance, making it an ideal investment opportunity in Dubai’s luxury real estate market.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/feat_60ae7b3822.jpg","hash":"feat_60ae7b3822","name":"feat.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/banner_50d052a654.jpg","hash":"banner_50d052a654","name":"banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/5_97280e7386.jpg","hash":"5_97280e7386","name":"The Bristol by Emaar"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/9_4bb11ac5b8.jpg","hash":"9_4bb11ac5b8","name":"9.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/4_4025ec7da2.jpg","hash":"4_4025ec7da2","name":"4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/1_857f26fbf7.jpg","hash":"1_857f26fbf7","name":"1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/8_502e823674.jpg","hash":"8_502e823674","name":"8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/7_74703c84bc.jpg","hash":"7_74703c84bc","name":"7.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/2_dddca73ba4.jpg","hash":"2_dddca73ba4","name":"2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/3_3ffe63e24f.jpg","hash":"3_3ffe63e24f","name":"3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/10_2021966b4b.jpg","hash":"10_2021966b4b","name":"10.jpg"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1323,"cta":{"id":2092,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/sellingpoint_ef162a8538.jpg","hash":"sellingpoint_ef162a8538","name":"sellingpoint.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"The Bristol at Emaar Beachfront Dubai: A Luxurious Seaside Haven","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Iconic Waterfront Living – A landmark tower with a state-of-the-art design inspired by movement, flow, and rhythm.</li><li>Branded Luxury Residences – High-end interiors and exquisite furnishings offer a refined and elegant living experience.</li><li>Prime Location – Strategically situated in Emaar Beachfront, minutes away from Sheikh Zayed Road, Dubai Harbour, Marina &amp; Yacht Club, Palm Jumeirah, JBR, and Burj Al Arab.</li><li>Mesmerizing Views – Uninterrupted vistas of Palm Jumeirah, Atlantis, Dubai Marina, and Burj Al Arab.</li><li>Resort-Style Amenities – Infinity pools, private beach access, a state-of-the-art gym, specialty restaurants, a cinema, a bowling alley, and spa &amp; wellness facilities.</li><li>Branded Residences – Choose from 1- to 4-bedroom apartments or exclusive 5-bedroom penthouses with floor-to-ceiling windows that bring in natural light and panoramic views.</li><li>World-Class Developer – Developed by Emaar, a globally recognized leader with a track record of delivering over 108,000 residential units, including iconic landmarks like Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall.</li><li>Easy Payment Plan – Secure your luxury residence with just 10% down payment and an easy payment plan with only 20% on handover, making it an attractive investment opportunity.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1324,"cta":{"id":2093,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/MAP_668b947f87.jpg","hash":"MAP_668b947f87","name":"MAP.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Prime Location of The Bristol at Emaar Beachfront Dubai","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue"